  "description": "Wallet Notify Feature for Blockcore Node. This feature allows you to configure a shell command to be executed whenever an transaction is observed in the wallet. Event is triggered both when transaction is added to the mempool, and when it is mined/staked into a block. When the wallet is rescanned, the events will trigger again. Make sure your software that dependes on notifications handles being triggered multiple times on same transaction ID.",
